36352>>>>>>>    Function StringToTime DateTime dtTime String sTimeString Returns DateTime
36354>>>>>>>        String sHours sMinutes sSeconds
36354>>>>>>>        
36354>>>>>>>        //  Extract parts
36354>>>>>>>        Move (Mid(sTimeString, 2, 1)) to sHours
