36358>>>>>>>        Move (DateSetMinute(dtTime, (Integer(sMinutes)))) to dtTime
36359>>>>>>>        Move (DateSetSecond(dtTime, (Integer(sSeconds)))) to dtTime
36360>>>>>>>        
36360>>>>>>>        Function_Return dtTime
36361>>>>>>>    End_Function
