36821>>>>>        Set Field_Changed_Value of hoUserDD Field WebAppUser.FullName to sLoginName
36822>>>>>        Set Field_Changed_Value of hoUserDD Field WebAppUser.LoginName to sLoginName
36823>>>>>        If (not(CreatePasswordHash(Self, Trim(sPassword), &sPassword))) Begin
36825>>>>>            Send Clear of hoUserDD
36826>>>>>            Function_Return False
36827>>>>>        End
36827>>>>>>
36827>>>>>        Set Field_Changed_Value of hoUserDD Field WebAppUser.Password to sPassword
36828>>>>>        Get Request_Validate of hoUserDD to iErr
36829>>>>>        If (iErr) Begin
36831>>>>>            Send Clear of hoUserDD
